embeds.description:
We've paused Venice for everyone while we fix an issue from the NBA 2K27 update. {DETAIL}

Venice will say: **"Venice is paused by the service right now. Nothing is wrong with your PC or internet."** That's expected. There's nothing to change on your side, and no need to reinstall.

We'll post here when it's back. Paused at {TIME}.

Venice **{VERSION}** fixes the NBA 2K27 update issue. {DETAIL}

**Restart Venice** and it updates itself. If the update doesn't finish, reinstall from <#1549499799861067876>. Your settings and shot timing history are kept.

Give it a few practice shots before a Rec or Park game.
